Replace-From: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
Replace-Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 04:29:11 +0800
Subject: dt-bindings: clock: document the Hi3798MV100 CRG in YAML

The Hi3798MV100 clock and reset generator has no place in the schema.
Add the part's CRG compatibles to hisilicon,hisi-crg.yaml; the per-SoC
clock id headers come with the driver block.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)


diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/hisilicon,hisi-crg.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/hisilicon,hisi-crg.yaml
